    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n111737" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλεγμον-ή</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fiery heat,</i> dub.l. in <i><span class="en">
